Fingerprint Manager is a new Python / Qt 6 / Kirigami implementation.

Design and feature reference:
  CS9711 Manager by Mahmud Farooque
  https://github.com/mmhfarooque/chipsailing-cs9711-fingerprint-linux
  Reviewed at commit 14e6df0fe6bf4729ca076ab433f5f8babea7fa64
  Original project: MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Mahmud Farooque

No original GTK source, installer scripts, or original artwork are bundled.

KDE's dedicated fingerprint PAM service was checked against KScreenLocker:
  https://invent.kde.org/plasma/kscreenlocker
  greeter/pamauthenticators.cpp

The runtime configuration is supplied by the installed distribution, not copied
from a hardcoded PAM template in this project.
